Third-party material
====================

Go standard library parser components
-------------------------------------

Parts of crates/parser are derived from the Go standard library, including
code and test data originating from the following packages and components:

- go/parser
- go/scanner
- go/token
- go/ast
- go/strconv (only the portions adapted for parser support)

